# .env.test is deliberately TRACKED (BUGS-TO-FIX F18): it is the secret-free
# test contract (KERNEL_CLASS, relaxed rate limits, agent test defaults).
# Ignoring it made `php bin/phpunit` fail on any fresh clone and on CI with
# "You must set the KERNEL_CLASS environment variable".

